'Rocco, Cabaretti Caterer', "Rogues' Gallery", 'Rooftop Nuisance', 'Rumor Gatherer', 'Run Out of Town', 'Sanctuary Warden', 'Sanguine Spy', 'Scheming Fence', 'Scuttling Butler', 'Security Bypass', 'Security Rhox', 'Sewer Crocodile', 'Shadow of Mortality', 'Shakedown Heavy', 'Shattered Seraph', 'Sizzling Soloist', 'Sky Crier', 'Skybridge Towers', 'Sleep with the Fishes', 'Slip Out the Back', 'Snooping Newsie', 'Social Climber', 'Soul of Emancipation', "Spara's Adjudicators", "Spara's Headquarters", 'Speakeasy Server', 'Sticky Fingers', 'Stimulus Package', 'Strangle', 'Structural Assault', 'Suspicious Bookcase', 'Swamp', 'Swooping Protector', 'Syndicate Infiltrator', 'Tainted Indulgence', 'Take to the Streets', 'Tavern Swindler', 'Tenacious Underdog', 'Titan of Industry', 'Toluz, Clever Conductor', 'Topiary Stomper', 'Torch Breath', 'Tramway Station', 'Undercover Operative', 'Unleash the Inferno', 'Unlicensed Hearse', 'Unlucky Witness', 'Urabrask, Heretic Praetor', 'Vampire Scrivener', 'Venom Connoisseur', 'Vivien on the Hunt', 'Voice of the Vermin', 'Void Rend', 'Warm Welcome', 'Waterfront District', 'Whack', 'Widespread Thieving', 'Wingshield Agent', 'Wiretapping', 'Witness Protection', 'Witty Roastmaster', 'Workshop Warchief', 'Wrecking Crew', "Xander's Lounge", "Ziatora's Envoy", "Ziatora's Proving Ground", 'Ziatora, the Incinerator']
