orest Plains', 'Land — Plains Island Swamp', 'Land — Swamp Mountain Forest', 'Legendary Artifact — Equipment', 'Legendary Creature — Angel', 'Legendary Creature — Bird Demon', 'Legendary Creature — Cat Citizen', 'Legendary Creature — Cat Demon', 'Legendary Creature — Cephalid Advisor', 'Legendary Creature — Demon Dragon', 'Legendary Creature — Elf Druid', 'Legendary Creature — Human Rogue', 'Legendary Creature — Human Soldier', 'Legendary Creature — Human Warrior', 'Legendary Creature — Phyrexian Praetor', 'Legendary Creature — Rhino Warrior', 'Legendary Creature — Sphinx Demon', 'Legendary Creature — Vampire Demon Noble', 'Legendary Creature — Vampire Rogue', 'Legendary Creature — Viashino Warrior', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Elspeth', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Nixilis', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Vivien', 'Sorcery']
